The '''Shaper's Terrace''' is an area located in the [[Un'Goro Crater]]. It is devoid of NPCs.

==Notes and trivia==
* It is possible to jump up to the Shaper's Terrace using wallclimbing. Alternatively, a [[Riding Gryphon]] can be found at the <Farmers Market> guild base located west of [[Marshal's Refuge]].{{coords|39.0|11.8|Un'Goro Crater}}
* The Shaper's Terrace was formerly home to the [[Keepers of Outerend]], who were removed in an unknown update.

